OL,3,GNEWSAPlane lifted into back garden as
OL,4,Abunker takes shape
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen asked why he had lifted a section
OL,7,Fof a former plane into the ground in
OL,8,Fhis back garden, Dave Billings shrugged
OL,9,Fhis shoulders and said: "Why not?"
OL,11,FThe 45-year-old recently used a huge
OL,12,Fcrane to lower the fuselage of an old
OL,13,FBmibaby Boeing 737-500 into a large
OL,14,Fhole in his lawn, after buying it
OL,15,Fonline for #4,000.
OL,17,FA team of volunteers helped to lower
OL,18,Fthe aircraft cabin into position at his
OL,19,Fhome in Hilton in Derbyshire.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
