OL,3,GNEWSAPlane lifted into back garden as
OL,4,Abunker takes shape
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave has now adapted it to allow the
OL,7,Fspace to become an underground "man
OL,8,Fcave", and it will ultimately connect
OL,9,Fto an existing underground room beneath
OL,10,Fhis garden.
